🌿 2. Key Modules & Technical CapabilitiesA. Multi-Spectral Earth Observation & NDVI Engine (satellite_engine.py)Simulated Sentinel-2 Bands:Band 4 (Red, 665 nm)Band 8 (Near-Infrared / NIR, 842 nm)Band 3 (Green, 560 nm)Band 11 (Shortwave Infrared / SWIR, 1610 nm)NDVI Formula & Coverage Scoring: $$\text{NDVI} = \frac{\text{NIR} - \text{Red}}{\text{NIR} + \text{Red}}$$Categorical Land Classification:🌲 Dense Canopy Forest ($\text{NDVI} > 0.65$)🌳 Moderate Tree Cover ($0.45 \le \text{NDVI} \le 0.65$)🌾 Sparse Scrub & Grassland ($0.20 \le \text{NDVI} < 0.45$)🏜️ Barren Soil / Degraded Ground ($\text{NDVI} < 0.20$)💧 Water Bodies ($\text{NDVI} < 0.0$)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
B. Spatial Exclusion & Parcel Bank (osm_masking.py)Geometric Exclusion: Automatically masks and protects water bodies, wetlands, urban settlements, and private property using Shapely.Barren Parcel Allocation: Segments contiguous public fallow land into discrete plantable candidate parcels (PARCEL-A, PARCEL-B, etc.) with calculated area in hectares.Environmental Profiling: Computes terrain slope gradient, erosion risk, ambient AQI (PM2.5/PM10), soil pH, and distance to surface water.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C. 4-Pillar AI Botanical Matchmaking & Agronomic Advisor (recommendation_engine.py & ml_model.py)44+ Botanical Species & Crop Catalog:Canopy & Timber Forestry Trees: Azadirachta indica (Neem), Ficus religiosa (Peepal), Casuarina equisetifolia (Whistling Pine), Dalbergia sissoo (Shisham), Albizia lebbeck (Siris).Soil Anchor & Erosion Champions: Chrysopogon zizanioides (Vetiver Grass), Acacia nilotica (Babul).Sodic Land Reclaimers & Biofuel Pioneers: Millettia pinnata (Karanj), Prosopis cineraria (Khejri).Rainforest Buffer & Canopy Reconstructors: Terminalia arjuna (Arjun), Syzygium cumini (Jamun), Bambusa bambos (Giant Thorny Bamboo).Agronomic & Agroforestry Companion Crops: Cereals, pulses, spices, and horticulture companions.4-Pillar Multi-Criteria Analysis:Climate Compatibility: Thermal envelopes and precipitation bands.Water Demand & Hydrology: Drought tolerance vs. groundwater availability.Land & Soil Chemistry: N-P-K nutrient balancing, slope anchoring, and pH limits.AQI & Bio-Filtering: Particulate matter absorption and gaseous carbon capture.Machine Learning Regressor:Multi-output ExtraTreesRegressor ensemble predicting suitability score (%), survival probability (%), harvest yield ($t/\text{ha}$), carbon sequestration ($t\text{CO}_2\text{e}/\text{ha}/\text{yr}$), and optimal sapling density.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
D. Interactive GIS Frontend (frontend/)Leaflet Map Canvas: Satellite basemap with dynamic raster overlays for NDVI heatmaps.Interactive Parcel Inspector: Clickable candidate parcels displaying environmental telemetry, ML confidence scores, and species planting blueprints.Preset Hotspot Switcher: Fast navigation across 5 global ecological zones (Aravalli Degraded Ridge, Sahel Great Green Wall, Western Ghats Escarpment, Sierra Nevada Burn Scar, Central Kalimantan Peatland).Report & GeoJSON Export: One-click printable executive dossier and GeoJSON parcel boundaries.
